      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787772287083,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The pipeline layer: \n\nDeveloper → GitHub → GitHub Actions (with the OIDC and AI review) → Staging → (approval/merge) → Production.\n\nThe delivery layer: \n\nReal visitor’s request reaches the website = Visitor → CloudFront → S3, with ACM providing the certificate.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The pipeline layer: \n\nDeveloper → GitHub → GitHub Actions (with the OIDC and AI review) → Staging → (approval/merge) → Production.\n\nThe delivery layer: \n\nReal visitor’s request reaches the website = Visitor → CloudFront → S3, with ACM providing the certificate.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
